Ready to take the discussion on Cybersecurity and AI to the next level? LICS CyberFest is honored to welcome Bruno Guerreiro, an executive with 20 years of experience in the Information Security ecosystem.

Based directly in Lyon, France, where he serves as Cyber Security Operations Center Manager at INTERPOL, as well as CTO and Advisory Leader at Datasec, Bruno specializes in cyber operations management (SOC/SecOps), incident response, and threat intelligence.

In addition to his frontline global work, he has a strong connection to education, having previously served as an instructor at GoHacking and for postgraduate programs at FIA Business School and FIA Online.

In his talk, “Cyber Threats & Artificial Intelligence – Two Sides of the Same Coin,” he will share his strategic perspective on how AI is simultaneously transforming attackers’ arsenals and the defensive capabilities of cybersecurity teams.
